hone. ID_A's voice is a casual young male voice with warm tone, quick pacing, and a nervous brightness that becomes sharper under pressure. ID_A says: \\\"Morning, everyone. Same street, same coffee, same life. Somehow you still keep watching.\\\" Realistic live-action modern thriller with natural morning light, grounded performances, and subtle phone-video realism. Handheld selfie-style framing follows ID_A. A sunny Los Angeles sidewalk with a coffee shop, parked cars, palm shadows, and morning commuters. Traffic hum, phone recording beep, footsteps, distant espresso machine. Light electronic vlog music plays softly, slightly too polished for the casual scene.","","",""]},{"id":51,"type":"CR Prompt Text","pos":[21845.238772754394,-165.13674572761406],"size":[278.1111755371094,170.47019958496094],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"prompt","localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"}}],"outputs":[{"label":"prompt","localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","links":[59]},{"label":"show_help","localized_name":"show_help","name":"show_help","type":"STRING"}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes","ver":"unknown","Node name for S&R":"CR Prompt Text","ue_properties":{"version":"7.8","widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Roles & Subjects: 28-year-old British male archaeologist, short brown hair, wearing wire-rimmed glasses and a light brown vintage trench coat. Voice: deep, calm, and intellectual.\n注意：说话部分的文字不要翻译成英文，直接用中文，其他部分用英文\n场景1：\nAction & Dialogue：The man gently brushes dust off a massive, ancient leather-bound book on a dark wooden table, looks up at the camera with a surprised and excited expression, and says: \"天呐，找了这么久，终于让我找到关于古代遗迹的关键线索了！这绝对是一个巨大的突破。\"\nCamera Movement：Slow macro close-up of the ancient book cover, smoothly panning up to a stable close-up of his face.\nBackground：An ancient, grand library with towering wooden bookshelves, warm sunlight filtering through stained glass windows.\nSound Effects & BGM ：Soft, mysterious piano chords, the tactile rustling sound of old paper, faint wind whispering outside.\n场景2：\nAction & Dialogue：The man stands before a colossal, ruined stone archway, holding an old parchment map in his hands, looking around carefully, and says: \"根据地图上的标记，古老入口应该就在这附近。我们得赶在落日之前找到它。\"\nCamera Movement：Medium shot, slow tracking shot following him as he takes a few steps forward, keeping his face clearly framed.\nBackground：Ancient Roman ruins at sunset, dramatic warm orange and golden hour lighting casting long shadows.\nSound Effects & BGM ：Low, ambient synth pad with a sense of adventure, sound of dry wind blowing, footsteps on gravel."]},{"id":52,"type":"CR Prompt Text","pos":[22588.7734375,-43.09230422973633],"size":[392.3506774902344,108],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"prompt","localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"}}],"outputs":[{"label":"prompt","localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","links":[60]},{"label":"show_help","localized_name":"show_help","name":"show_help","type":"STRING"}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes","ver":"unknown","Node name for S&R":"CR Prompt Text","ue_properties":{"version":"7.8","widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["You are a professional shot-prompt writer for a joint audio-video generation model. Given a user's story (a premise, theme, or outline), expand it into an ordered sequence of shot prompts — ALL shots in one response. Each shot is one 3-to-8-second clip (3-8s) the model renders with synchronized video and audio.\nSTRICT OUTPUT FORMAT (MUST FOLLOW EXACTLY)\nOutput MUST be a single valid JSON object and NOTHING else:\n{\"prompts\": [\"<shot 1 prompt>\", \"<shot 2 prompt>\", ...]}\nNo text before or after the JSON. No explanations, no comments, no markdown code fences (```), no trailing commas.\n\"prompts\" is a JSON array of STRINGS. Each string = exactly one shot.\nEach string is ONE single continuous English paragraph. Inside a string there must be NO field names, NO keys, NO labels, NO bullet points, and NO line breaks (no \"\\n\") — merge everything into one flowing paragraph.\nThe spoken line, when present, is embedded inside the paragraph with escaped double quotes: ... ID_A says, \"...\" ...\nONLY the spoken dialogue itself is written in Chinese. All other descriptions (actions, style, background, music, etc.) MUST be in English.\nSPEECH IS OPTIONAL PER SHOT (IMPORTANT)\nNot every shot has spoken dialogue. Decide per shot whether characters speak.\nUse NON-SPEAKING shots for establishing, mood, reaction, object-detail, or transition beats.\nFor a non-speaking shot, omit all voice sentences, lip-sync notes, and spoken lines, letting the action and environment carry the sequence.\nCHARACTER CONSISTENCY (CRITICAL — DO NOT LET IDENTITY DRIFT)\nGive each recurring character a stable ID (ID_A, ID_B, ...). Reserve IDs for PEOPLE only.\nFor each recurring visible character, repeat the EXACT SAME base identity sentence, clothing sentence, and voice sentence in every shot where they appear. Copy these sentences verbatim — do not paraphrase or change a single word between shots.\nThe base identity sentence describes only stable appearance (age, build, hair, face). It must NOT contain temporary expressions.\nWHAT EACH SHOT PARAGRAPH CONTAINS (STRICT INTERNAL ORDER)\nFor every shot, weave the descriptions into a single paragraph in this EXACT order:\nCharacter Base Identity & Clothing (Verbatim): \"ID_X is a... [stable physical description]. ID_X wears... [clothing description].\"\nCharacter Voice (Verbatim, only if speaking): \"ID_X's voice is a... [register, tone, and pacing].\"\nCurrent Expression & Lip-Sync Setup (Only if speaking): \"Her/His expression is... [expression/mood]. The mouth movement is clearly visible in the frame and stays naturally synchronized with the spoken line, reading well on the [mood/pacing] phrases.\"\nAction (Temporal order): Must start with \"At normal speed, \" followed by the action. If speaking, end the action description with: \", the lip movement aligning closely with the audio throughout the sentence.\" (Ensure actions are simple to fit the 3-8s duration).\nDialogue Delivery & Line (Only if speaking, Chinese only): \"In a [voice description/pacing], ID_X says, \"[Chinese dialogue]\"\" (Keep the line short, roughly 5–12 words, to fit the 3-8s clip).\nVisual Style: \"The shot uses a... [aesthetic style, lighting, and palette].\"\nCamera Framing & Motion: \"A [framing/motion description] frames ID_X's face/body, keeping [features/mouth/subject] clearly readable.\"\nBackground Setting: \"The background features... [location details, scenery, and lighting].\"\nSound Effects (SFX): \"[List of diegetic sounds] are audible.\"\nBackground Music (BGM): \"[BGM description] plays beneath the clear dialogue.\" (Or \"plays softly in the background\" if non-speaking).\nDRAMATIC ARC\nBuild a clear emotional arc: an opening that sets mood, a rising line of realization or tension, a turning point or discovery, a vulnerable low beat, and a resolution. Alternate speaking and non-speaking shots to control pacing.\nMODEL-FRIENDLY (AVOID GENERATION FAILURE)\nFavor gentle, simple, physically plausible actions (standing, sitting, slow turning, walking slowly, reaching, holding, small gestures). Avoid fast/complex motion (running, fighting, collisions, acrobatics)."]},{"id":54,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[23062.576171875,-134.4157257080078],"size":[676.4615478515625,210.88075256347656],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"source","localized_name":"源","name":"source","type":"*","link":65}],"outputs":[{"label":"STRING","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING"}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.24.0","Node name for S&R":"PreviewAny","ue_properties":{